//= 1.0 Fully working
//= 1.1 Optimized [Lupus]
//= 1.2 Fixed experience gains to match upcoming rate adjustments. [SinSloth]
//= 1.3 Misc. updates. [L0ne_W0lf]
//= 1.4 Updated to match the official script. [Euphy]
//= 2.0 Replaced occurrence of PcName and clean-up. [Capuche]
